What:		/sys/bus/pci/drivers/qaic/XXXX:XX:XX.X/hwmon/hwmon<N>/power_level
Date:		July 2023
KernelVersion:	6.4
Contact:	Jeffrey Hugo <quic_jhugo@quicinc.com>
Description:	Show the current configured power level. Allows the level to be set to a
		different level. The power levels are:
		1 - full power
		2 - reduced power
		3 - minimal power
		Configuring a different power level impacts the permitted power consumption
		of the device, and thus may impact the performance of the device.
Users:		Any userspace application or clients interested to view or change this
		device configuration.

